{"vid":"vHtHOumts7k","source":"vHtHOumts7k.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":35.7,"txt":"You may have thought welding was only"},{"t":37.6,"txt":"about arcs and sparks. Well, think"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"again. Hello, I'm Nancy Cole, president"},{"t":44.3,"txt":"of the American Welding Society. Welding"},{"t":47.3,"txt":"is a staple of American industry, one"},{"t":50.2,"txt":"with diverse and challenging jobs of all"},{"t":52.7,"txt":"kinds. From technicians to instructors"},{"t":56.5,"txt":"and even CEOs."},{"t":58.7,"txt":"But it's not just a job for men. Every"},{"t":61.6,"txt":"day, more and more women are enjoying"},{"t":64.5,"txt":"the benefits of being part of the"},{"t":66.7,"txt":"welding industry."},{"t":68.8,"txt":"Let's take a look at just some of the"},{"t":70.7,"txt":"exciting careers which are available to"},{"t":73.8,"txt":"women who take the leap into a career in"},{"t":76.8,"txt":"welding."},{"t":86.5,"txt":"My name is Amanda Sheffller and I'm a"},{"t":88.4,"txt":"welding instructor at Community College."},{"t":91.2,"txt":"I discovered welding uh in 10th grade"},{"t":93.9,"txt":"because I wanted to take a class that"},{"t":96.2,"txt":"would not send me home with too much"},{"t":98.1,"txt":"homework. So, I took the class and"},{"t":100.7,"txt":"immediately immediately fell in love"},{"t":102.6,"txt":"with it. After high school, I was"},{"t":105.5,"txt":"offered a full ride scholarship if I"},{"t":107.7,"txt":"competed in in welding um for"},{"t":112.5,"txt":"also um working as a lab tech while"},{"t":115.8,"txt":"doing uh the welding competition. So I"},{"t":118.5,"txt":"would actually go around and coach"},{"t":119.9,"txt":"students individually in their booths."},{"t":123.4,"txt":"That's when I discovered that I really"},{"t":125,"txt":"enjoyed teaching because I really"},{"t":126.8,"txt":"enjoyed for me it was satisfying to"},{"t":130.2,"txt":"watch people actually progress and learn"},{"t":133.1,"txt":"and grow. And so being able to strike an"},{"t":136.6,"txt":"arc and control the fire and the flame"},{"t":138.9,"txt":"and actually create things and put"},{"t":140.6,"txt":"things together and build things I"},{"t":142.1,"txt":"thought was really incredible. It's"},{"t":144.3,"txt":"difficult to see myself doing anything"},{"t":145.8,"txt":"else besides teaching welding now that"},{"t":147.8,"txt":"I've that I've been here and I've been"},{"t":149.2,"txt":"able to experience the"},{"t":151.7,"txt":"self-fululfillment that you get from"},{"t":153,"txt":"being a teacher. So, honestly, in 5"},{"t":155,"txt":"years, I hope I'm just still part of"},{"t":156.9,"txt":"this team."},{"t":168.3,"txt":"Uh, my name is Ashley Webbble and I'm a"},{"t":170.6,"txt":"certified welding inspector at Roman"},{"t":172.6,"txt":"Engineering Services."},{"t":174.9,"txt":"I became interested in welding by"},{"t":177.1,"txt":"accident actually when I finally decided"},{"t":180.6,"txt":"that it was time for me to get an"},{"t":182.1,"txt":"education. I looked into the local"},{"t":183.9,"txt":"community college and they had um one of"},{"t":187.5,"txt":"the best welding programs in the world."},{"t":189.5,"txt":"So, I thought I would give it a try. But"},{"t":191.4,"txt":"once I was there, I absolutely fell in"},{"t":193.8,"txt":"love with it. You know, the idea that"},{"t":196.3,"txt":"most girls would have when they think"},{"t":198,"txt":"about welders, you know, it's a dirty"},{"t":199.7,"txt":"guy and you smoke and everything. Um,"},{"t":203.5,"txt":"it's not really like that at all, you"},{"t":205.8,"txt":"know. Um, yes, I get my hands dirty"},{"t":207.6,"txt":"sometimes, but to be honest with you, I"},{"t":209.4,"txt":"I do a lot of reading. I do a lot of"},{"t":211.4,"txt":"paperwork. Um, inspection of welds. The"},{"t":213.9,"txt":"inspections that I do help build"},{"t":217.3,"txt":"everything from bridges uh to the car"},{"t":219.8,"txt":"you see driving down the street um to"},{"t":222.5,"txt":"the bookshelf in your office. Uh I I"},{"t":225.1,"txt":"think it's really interesting that you"},{"t":226.8,"txt":"know most people walk around every day"},{"t":229,"txt":"not thinking about you know how much"},{"t":231.4,"txt":"welding affects our lives and where we"},{"t":233.4,"txt":"would be without it. It's it's amazing."},{"t":243.7,"txt":"I'm uh Veronica Gonzalez. I'm a welding"},{"t":246,"txt":"technician at NASA. I became interested"},{"t":249.4,"txt":"in welding when I saw that it was a"},{"t":252.6,"txt":"skill that I knew I could do and it was"},{"t":256.2,"txt":"very challenging. Welding is like an art"},{"t":258.6,"txt":"when it comes to the"},{"t":261.6,"txt":"small tedious work that not too many"},{"t":264.6,"txt":"people can do. One of my jobs here is to"},{"t":267.5,"txt":"weld the components for the jet pack for"},{"t":270.6,"txt":"the astronauts. A lot of that's orbital"},{"t":272.9,"txt":"welding."},{"t":278.6,"txt":"I feel very I guess privileged to do"},{"t":282.1,"txt":"that cuz it's something that the"},{"t":284.2,"txt":"astronauts are going to actually be"},{"t":286.2,"txt":"using in the future. I think more women"},{"t":289.1,"txt":"should look at getting in this career"},{"t":292,"txt":"cuz it's very interesting. you I mean"},{"t":294.2,"txt":"you learn every day. You keep learning"},{"t":296.5,"txt":"more and more. There's so many"},{"t":298.4,"txt":"challenges in welding that it just gives"},{"t":301.8,"txt":"you that drive to do it even more. I"},{"t":304.3,"txt":"would I mean I would do it all over"},{"t":305.8,"txt":"again if I had the chance. It's a good"},{"t":309,"txt":"career to get into it."},{"t":318.8,"txt":"Uh my name is Karen Gilgenbach and I'm a"},{"t":320.9,"txt":"weld process specialist at Air Gas. I"},{"t":324.2,"txt":"went to school for engineering"},{"t":325.5,"txt":"mechanics. When I was graduating from"},{"t":327.8,"txt":"school, I went to some engineering"},{"t":329.4,"txt":"career fairs. Uh I met a company called"},{"t":332,"txt":"Lindy Gas at that time. They were"},{"t":334.6,"txt":"looking for a technical sales rep. I was"},{"t":337.2,"txt":"really intrigued because when they"},{"t":338.6,"txt":"described the position, they told me"},{"t":340.3,"txt":"there'd be a lot of traveling to"},{"t":342.2,"txt":"different companies and seeing different"},{"t":343.8,"txt":"things every day. And I thought that"},{"t":345.6,"txt":"sounded more exciting than sitting"},{"t":347.1,"txt":"behind a desk. The program that I'm part"},{"t":349.5,"txt":"of uh is we partner with customers and"},{"t":352.5,"txt":"try to determine how we can help them"},{"t":354.2,"txt":"improve their processes. Testing. I do"},{"t":356.6,"txt":"macro etches for customers. I do bend"},{"t":358.6,"txt":"tests for customers to evaluate quality."},{"t":361,"txt":"Um I help them with their documentation."},{"t":363.4,"txt":"uh if they have code requirements they"},{"t":365,"txt":"have to meet. Um I definitely help them"},{"t":367.5,"txt":"with uh robotics uh or automation if"},{"t":370,"txt":"that's something that they're looking"},{"t":371,"txt":"at."},{"t":376.2,"txt":"But not terribly. It's always amazing to"},{"t":378.9,"txt":"me. Sometimes it's breathtaking the"},{"t":381,"txt":"things that people can manufacture and I"},{"t":383,"txt":"I love being part of it and I definitely"},{"t":384.6,"txt":"feel a sense of pride. I definitely"},{"t":387.1,"txt":"think it's a job that women can do and I"},{"t":389,"txt":"think in some respects I think it's more"},{"t":391,"txt":"rewarding to do it as a woman. There are"},{"t":393.1,"txt":"women I meet, younger women that are at"},{"t":394.9,"txt":"the technical college that are learning"},{"t":396.4,"txt":"and it's very rewarding to be able to"},{"t":398.1,"txt":"expose them to that and work with them"},{"t":400,"txt":"and and maybe maybe surprise them a"},{"t":403,"txt":"little bit. So,"},{"t":417.5,"txt":"my name is Jenny McCall and I'm"},{"t":419.3,"txt":"president of Westco Gas and Welding"},{"t":421.4,"txt":"Supply Company out of Mobile, Alabama."},{"t":424,"txt":"Uh we have nine locations along the Gulf"},{"t":425.9,"txt":"Coast. Uh my dad is a businessman, a"},{"t":429.3,"txt":"welder and and uh as a uh child growing"},{"t":433.4,"txt":"up, I was always in the business. So in"},{"t":435.8,"txt":"um the summers and Christmas breaks, I"},{"t":438.2,"txt":"would work for the company. You know, I"},{"t":440.9,"txt":"decided, you know, maybe I don't want to"},{"t":443.3,"txt":"go into this career field. So, I I went"},{"t":446.5,"txt":"to college and actually went and worked"},{"t":448.6,"txt":"at a uh in a different industry"},{"t":452.4,"txt":"um for a couple years and decided that's"},{"t":455.9,"txt":"not what I wanted. I wanted to come back"},{"t":457.9,"txt":"into into the business because I really"},{"t":460.6,"txt":"enjoyed the industry,"},{"t":466.5,"txt":"you know, just knowing that the country"},{"t":470.5,"txt":"is built off of weld and that's what"},{"t":473.4,"txt":"fascinated me to this industry. And"},{"t":476.3,"txt":"again, you don't have to be a welder to"},{"t":477.9,"txt":"be in our field. You can it's so"},{"t":480.4,"txt":"diversified. You can do anything. you"},{"t":483.1,"txt":"know, it takes a combination of of"},{"t":486.6,"txt":"individuals to make this industry work."},{"t":490.5,"txt":"My advice to to somebody that's thinking"},{"t":493.4,"txt":"about coming into the industry, do it."},{"t":496.3,"txt":"It is so much fun. And um there's so"},{"t":500.5,"txt":"many different opportunities in the"},{"t":502.6,"txt":"field uh of welding."},{"t":508.6,"txt":"As you can see, welding can pave the way"},{"t":511.8,"txt":"for many exciting career paths. It's an"},{"t":515.5,"txt":"industry with a bright and promising"},{"t":517.6,"txt":"future, one filled with all sorts of"},{"t":520.8,"txt":"opportunities for women. I invite you to"},{"t":524.1,"txt":"learn more by visiting"},{"t":526.7,"txt":"careersinwelding.com."}],"words":[{"t":